==Trivia== 
*'''Rusty''' used to have no shop and only applied {{Blue|'''Telekinesis'''}} on tools for {{C|100}}. This was changed alongside the introduction of [[Auto-pickup]].
*The {{Item|White Belt}} (and its upgrades), [[Kuudra Follower Armor]], {{Item|Campfire Initiate Badge}} (and its upgrades), {{Item|Soul Campfire Initiate Badge}} (and its upgrades), {{Item|Book of Progression}}, {{Item|Shiny Yellow Rock}} (and its upgrades), {{Item|Beastslayer's Codex}}, {{Item|Kuudra Follower Artifact}} (and its upgrade, {{Item|Kuudra Follower Relic}}), {{Item|Kuudra Teeth Plaque}} and {{Item|Safari Belt}} are not affected by the discount from {{Item|Shady Ring}}, {{Item|Crooked Artifact}}, or {{Item|Seal of the Family}}. It is unknown if this is intentional or a bug.
*Buying {{Item|Safari Belt}} will give the player the item with the exact same upgrades as their last modified one. {{InfoNeeded}}

